  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dialogue Initiatives Philippines 2020-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Philippine Peace Programme will continue to be two-folded, with 1) a focus on the resumption of the peace negotiations between the GRP and NDFP with the goal of reaching a final peace agreement and 2) peace governance in Mindanao with a strong focus on youth.</narrative>
  </description>
